    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9100-0445"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An explicit rational continuous DSIC stream-dual witness and exact
  Bernstein certificate give a global upper bound for the canonical
  two-bidder, two-item independent-uniform auction; an exact deterministic
  mechanism supplies a separate lower bound, and the unrestricted optimum
  remains open.
